        <part lastModifyTime="0" updateMethod="0">
            <t index="1" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:01,200</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:07,400</end-time>
                <translation>如何才能避免战争</translation>
                <original>戦争を避けるにはどうすればいいのか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="2" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:07,400</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:10,750</end-time>
                <translation>法国人类学家罗歇·凯卢瓦</translation>
                <original>フランスの人類学者ロジェ・カイヨワは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="3" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:10,750</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:14,875</end-time>
                <translation>怀着对和平的祈愿撰写了《战争论》
平和を願い戦争論を執筆しました</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="4" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:16,850</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:22,450</end-time>
                <translation>然而战争至今从未停止</translation>
                <original>しかし現在に至るまで戦争が止むことはありません</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="5" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:22,450</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:26,850</end-time>
                <translation>岂止如此 随着技术的进步 战争</translation>
                <original>それどころか技術の進歩によって戦争は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="6" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:26,850</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:31,300</end-time>
                <translation>已远远凌驾于人类的知性能力</translation>
                <original>人間の知的能力を遥かに凌駕するものとなっています</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="7" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:33,850</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:38,540</end-time>
                <translation>人类究竟能否停止战争呢</translation>
                <original>果たして人類は戦争を止めることができるのでしょうか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="8" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:40,415</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:42,225</end-time>
                <translation>100分de名著</translation>
                <original>100分で名著</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="9" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:42,225</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:47,060</end-time>
                <translation>本回将从凯卢瓦的思想出发 思考当下能做什么</translation>
                <original>カイヨワの思想から今私たちに何ができるのかを考えます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="10" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:08,075</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:13,550</end-time>
                <translation>第4回 战争倾向和刹车</translation>
                <original>第4回　戦争への傾きとストッパー</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="11" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:14,530</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:16,920</end-time>
                <translation>100分de名著的主持人安部美智子
100分で名著司会の安部みちこです</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="12" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:16,950</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:17,844</end-time>
                <translation>伊集院光
伊集院光です</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="13" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:17,844</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:21,225</end-time>
                <translation>本月我们正在解读罗歇·凯卢瓦的《战争论》</translation>
                <original>今月はロジェ・カイヨワの戦争論を読み解いています</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="14" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:21,225</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:23,050</end-time>
                <translation>伊集院 上回感觉如何？</translation>
                <original>伊集院さん前回いかがでしたか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="15" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:23,050</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:26,525</end-time>
                <translation>嗯 对战争的理解又加深了</translation>
                <original>まあまた戦争への理解は深まったんですが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="16" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:26,525</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:29,025</end-time>
                <translation>我今天最为期待的是</translation>
                <original>今日僕はどうしても期待するのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="17" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:29,025</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:34,100</end-time>
                <translation>那么 战争究竟能否避免呢</translation>
                <original>で戦争は避けられるのか避けられないのか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="18" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:34,100</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:35,650</end-time>
                <translation>这个呢</translation>
                <original>なんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="19" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:35,650</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:36,625</end-time>
                <translation>书上是怎么写的呢</translation>
                <original>どう書かれてるんでしょうね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="20" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:36,625</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:37,775</end-time>
                <translation>毕竟是最后一夜了嘛</translation>
                <original>最終夜ですもんね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="21" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:37,775</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:40,860</end-time>
                <translation>好的 有请我们的指导老师</translation>
                <original>はい指南役ご紹介させていただきます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="22" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:40,860</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:43,075</end-time>
                <translation>哲学家西谷修
哲学者の西谷修さんです</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="23" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:43,075</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:45,900</end-time>
                <translation>请多关照</translation>
                <original>よろしくお願いいたします</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="24" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:45,900</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:49,300</end-time>
                <translation>西谷老师 最后一回会教给我们什么呢？</translation>
                <original>西谷さん最終回ではどんなことを教えてくださるんでしょうか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="25" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:49,300</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:54,350</end-time>
                <translation>凯卢瓦认为 战争已经整体化并在世界范围内推进</translation>
                <original>カイヨワは戦争が全体化して世界で進んでしまったという</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="26" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:54,350</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:57,417</end-time>
                <translation>而在战争的终极阶段</translation>
                <original>まあその戦争の究極にね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="27" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:57,417</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:01,425</end-time>
                <translation>开发出了核武器这样的歼灭性武器
核兵器のような殲滅兵器が開発されて</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="28" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:01,425</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:05,075</end-time>
                <translation>从某种意义上说 这使得战争无法进行了</translation>
                <original>それによって戦争ができなくなったある意味ではね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="29" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:05,075</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:06,559</end-time>
                <translation>虽然如此</translation>
                <original>なんだけれども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="30" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:06,559</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:10,800</end-time>
                <translation>但此后战争从未断绝过</translation>
                <original>その後戦争が途絶えたことはないわけです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="31" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:10,800</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:14,267</end-time>
                <translation>战争以各种形式持续着</translation>
                <original>いろいろ形を変えて継続していて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="32" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:14,267</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:16,700</end-time>
                <translation>其性质也发生了变化</translation>
                <original>また質も変わってると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="33" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:16,700</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:19,450</end-time>
                <translation>因此 我们在看到这种状况的同时</translation>
                <original>だからその状況を見ながら</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="34" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:19,450</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:21,808</end-time>
                <translation>对凯卢瓦的思考</translation>
                <original>カイヨワの考え</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="35" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:21,808</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:24,775</end-time>
                <translation>或者基于这本书中所写的内容</translation>
                <original>あるいはこの本に書いたこと何かを踏まえて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="36" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:24,775</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:31,125</end-time>
                <translation>我们为了阻止战争或者为了减少战争</translation>
                <original>私たちが戦争をとどめるために あるいは少なくするために</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="37" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:31,125</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:33,019</end-time>
                <translation>能够做些什么</translation>
                <original>どういうことができるのかと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="38" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:33,019</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:35,825</end-time>
                <translation>这就是我今天想和大家一起思考的</translation>
                <original>いうことまで考えていきたいと思っています</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="39" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:35,825</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:39,000</end-time>
                <translation>那么首先 随着核武器的登场</translation>
                <original>さあまずは核兵器が登場したことによって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="40" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:39,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:41,285</end-time>
                <translation>让我们来看看战争发生了怎样的变化</translation>
                <original>戦争がどう変わったのか見ていきましょう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="41" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:43,360</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:46,600</end-time>
                <translation>凯卢瓦分析认为 战争发生根本性变质
戦争が根本的な変質を遂げたのは</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="42" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:46,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:50,740</end-time>
                <translation>是以核武器的登场为契机</translation>
                <original>核兵器の登場がきっかけだとカイヨワは分析します</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="43" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:54,365</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:59,025</end-time>
                <translation>核武器这种能到达远距离的大规模杀戮工具
核兵器という遠距離まで届く大量殺戮の道具は</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="44" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:59,025</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:04,725</end-time>
                <translation>起到了将抗争扩大到全球规模的作用
抗争を全地球的規模に拡大する役を果たした</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="45" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:04,725</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:08,275</end-time>
                <translation>战争走向大规模破坏</translation>
                <original>戦争が大量破壊的なものとなるのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="46" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:08,275</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:11,375</end-time>
                <translation>已经是不可避免的了</translation>
                <original>もう不可避なことであった</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="47" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:11,375</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:14,075</end-time>
                <translation>在这样的条件下</translation>
                <original>このような条件においては</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="48" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:14,075</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:18,260</end-time>
                <translation>战争将超出国民这一框架</translation>
                <original>戦争は国民という枠をはみ出してしまう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="49" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:19,635</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:21,640</end-time>
                <translation>由于核武器的登场
核兵器の登場により</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="50" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:21,640</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:24,700</end-time>
