                <translation>在下方激烈地进行着</translation>
                <original>下でゴッゴッと行われているということだった</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="114" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:20,800</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:22,350</end-time>
                <translation>一点点地喷发出来</translation>
                <original>ちょっとずつ吹き出す</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="115" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:22,350</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:25,220</end-time>
                <translation>以不使用核武器为前提</translation>
                <original>核兵器を使わないという形で</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="116" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:25,220</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:29,650</end-time>
                <translation>开发各种新式武器来进行战争</translation>
                <original>あらゆる新しい武器を開発して行われるんですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="117" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:29,650</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:33,700</end-time>
                <translation>冷战就像是按下了暂停键</translation>
                <original>冷戦というのは一時停止ボタンみたいなのを押されているんだけれど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="118" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:33,700</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:36,275</end-time>
                <translation>但并不意味着一切都停止了</translation>
                <original>別に止まってるわけじゃないわけですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="119" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:36,275</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:38,100</end-time>
                <translation>反而是一直处于战争状态啊</translation>
                <original>まさに戦争状況なんですよ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="120" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:38,100</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:39,275</end-time>
                <translation>是啊</translation>
                <original>そうなんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="121" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:39,275</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:41,850</end-time>
                <translation>是进入了冷冻库的战争呢</translation>
                <original>冷凍庫に入った戦争なんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="122" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:41,850</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:43,275</end-time>
                <translation>也就是冷战呢</translation>
                <original>冷戦なんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="123" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:44,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:50,200</end-time>
                <translation>持续了40多年的冷战 在1980年代后半期 
40年以上続いた冷戦は1980年代後半</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="124" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:50,200</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:53,439</end-time>
                <translation>随着东方阵营的体制相继崩溃 
東側諸国の体制が次々に崩壊し</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="125" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:53,439</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:56,250</end-time>
                <translation>宣告终结</translation>
                <original>終結しました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="126" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:56,250</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:00,300</end-time>
                <translation>然而 新形态的战争登场了</translation>
                <original>しかし新たな形態の戦争が登場します</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="127" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:02,525</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:06,250</end-time>
                <translation>那就是反恐战争</translation>
                <original>テロとの戦争です</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="128" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:06,250</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:09,450</end-time>
                <translation>2001年9月11日发生的</translation>
                <original>2001年9月11日に起こった</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="129" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:09,450</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:11,780</end-time>
                <translation>美国九一一恐怖袭击事件 
アメリカ同時多発テロ事件</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="130" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:14,530</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:19,850</end-time>
                <translation>美国将奥萨马·本·拉登率领的武装组织“基地”组织</translation>
                <original>アメリカはオサマ・ビンラディン率いる武装集団アルカイダを</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="131" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:19,850</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:23,075</end-time>
                <translation>认定为恐怖袭击的实施者 
テロ実行犯と断定</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="132" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:23,075</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:29,250</end-time>
                <translation>并开始对其藏匿地阿富汗发动攻击</translation>
                <original>潜伏先のアフガニスタンへ攻撃を開始します</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="133" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:29,250</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:33,380</end-time>
                <translation>对阿富汗而言 这是侵犯主权的行为 </translation>
                <original>アフガニスタンにとっては主権侵害ですが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="134" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:33,380</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:37,220</end-time>
                <translation>但美国以消灭恐怖分子为借口 </translation>
                <original>アメリカはテロリスト撲滅を口実に</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="135" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:37,220</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:39,260</end-time>
                <translation>将攻击正当化了
攻撃を正当化しました</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="136" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:41,260</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:46,035</end-time>
                <translation>以此为契机 战争迈向了新的维度</translation>
                <original>これを契機に戦争は新たな次元へと向かいます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="137" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:49,660</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:53,460</end-time>
                <translation>由于反恐战争并非对国家的侵略 </translation>
                <original>テロとの戦争は国家への侵略ではないため</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="138" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:53,460</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:58,660</end-time>
                <translation>其战果便体现为恐怖分子的死亡人数</translation>
                <original>戦果はテロリストが何人死んだという殺害人数となります</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="139" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:01,710</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:05,325</end-time>
                <translation>此外 因为投降或媾和也无法成立 </translation>
                <original>また降伏や講和も成立しないため</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="140" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:05,325</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:11,180</end-time>
                <translation>我们变得无法预测这场战争将如何收场 </translation>
                <original>この戦争がどのように収束するのか 予測がつかないものになりました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="141" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:13,530</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:17,924</end-time>
                <translation>更进一步 美国针对潜伏在国内的恐怖分子 </translation>
                <original>さらにアメリカは国内に潜伏するテロリストに対する</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="142" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:17,924</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:21,000</end-time>
                <translation>加强了管制 
取締りを強化</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="143" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:21,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:23,300</end-time>
                <translation>颁布了《爱国者法案》 
愛国者法を発行し</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="144" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:23,300</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:26,450</end-time>
                <translation>通过放宽情报收集的管制等措施 
情報収集の規制緩和などによって</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="145" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:26,450</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:29,500</end-time>
                <translation>开始对国民进行常态化监视</translation>
                <original>常に国民を監視するようになりました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="146" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:31,925</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:37,325</end-time>
                <translation>这样一来 美国国内战时与平时的界限消失了 </translation>
                <original>これによってアメリカ国内は戦時と兵時の区別がなくなり</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="147" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:37,325</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:38,811</end-time>
                <translation>反恐战争</translation>
                <original>テロとの戦争を</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="148" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:38,811</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:42,260</end-time>
                <translation>由此产生在国内也必须持续进行战争的状态</translation>
                <original>国内でも続けなければならない状態が生まれます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="149" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:45,835</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:49,525</end-time>
                <translation>在此背景下 民间军事公司也应运而生
こうした中民間の軍事会社も登場し</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="150" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:49,525</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:52,235</end-time>
                <translation>美国的军事产业不断扩张
アメリカの軍事産業は拡大</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="151" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:54,335</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:57,375</end-time>
                <translation>进而对市民生活的方方面面
さらに市民の生活全般に</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="152" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:57,375</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:00,950</end-time>
                <translation>布下了战争的阴影</translation>
                <original>戦争の影響が影を落とすようになりました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="153" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:02,575</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:06,400</end-time>
                <translation>凯卢瓦仿佛预见到了这种状况</translation>
                <original>カイヨワはそんな状況を予見するかのように</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="154" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:06,400</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:08,150</end-time>
                <translation>这样说道</translation>
                <original>こう言っています</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="155" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:10,250</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:14,350</end-time>
                <translation>即便是各个研究所进行的研究</translation>
                <original>諸々の研究所で行われる研究にしても</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="156" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:14,350</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:19,275</end-time>
                <translation>那些有助于国家推进重武装化的研究</translation>
                <original>国が重武装化を進めていくのに役立つような研究が</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="157" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:19,275</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:22,375</end-time>
                <translation>也会被优先进行
優先的に行われた</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="158" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:22,375</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:26,220</end-time>
                <translation>人们整体生活的重组</translation>
                <original>人々の生活全体が組み替えられてしまうのも</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="159" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:26,220</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:29,650</end-time>
                <translation>也为期不远了</translation>
                <original>遠い先のことではなかった</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="160" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:29,650</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:32,780</end-time>
                <translation>为了尽可能有效地</translation>
                <original>敵に対してできるだけ有効で</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="161" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:32,780</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:36,380</end-time>
                <translation>对敌人造成致命的潜在打击
致命的な潜在的打撃を加えるために</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="162" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:36,380</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:40,625</end-time>
