                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="164" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:46,855</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:48,940</end-time>
                <translation>即使战争的形态发生了变化
戦争の形態は変化しても</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="165" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:48,940</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:54,320</end-time>
                <translation>国家至今依然如故 在国民所不知道的地方</translation>
                <original>国家は今も変わらず 国民の知らないところで</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="166" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:54,320</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:57,450</end-time>
                <translation>为准备战争而统合各个领域</translation>
                <original>戦争に向けてさまざまな分野を統合し</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="167" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:57,450</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:01,700</end-time>
                <translation>推进组织化进程</translation>
                <original>組織化を進めているのです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="168" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:01,700</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:04,700</end-time>
                <translation>这就像是名为战争的生物的进化呢</translation>
                <original>戦争という生き物の進化みたいなね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="169" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:04,700</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:07,225</end-time>
                <translation>逐渐变成了巨大的动物</translation>
                <original>どんどんでかい動物になっていって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="170" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:07,225</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:09,700</end-time>
                <translation>当它庞大到无法肆意妄为时</translation>
                <original>もう暴れられない大きさになっちゃったら</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="171" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:09,700</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:11,950</end-time>
                <translation>就出现了所谓的代理人战争</translation>
                <original>代理戦争みたいなのって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="172" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:11,950</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:15,100</end-time>
                <translation>就像是触手发达起来 在延伸的末端打架一样</translation>
                <original>触手が発達してその伸びた先で喧嘩するみたいな</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="173" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:15,100</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:17,050</end-time>
                <translation>变成了奇怪的生物</translation>
                <original>変な生き物になり</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="174" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:17,050</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:20,350</end-time>
                <translation>而像恐怖主义这类东西 因为形态不定</translation>
                <original>テロみたいなものは形が決まってないから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="175" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:20,350</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:23,560</end-time>
                <translation>就像它正在进行一种难以名状的进化呢</translation>
                <original>得体の知れない進化をちょっとしている感じに見えますね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="176" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:23,560</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:24,925</end-time>
                <translation>确实如此</translation>
                <original>本当ですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="177" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:24,925</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:28,975</end-time>
                <translation>倒不如说 这到底能不能称之为战争都很难说</translation>
                <original>むしろこれ戦争って言えるのかどうか分からないということなんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="178" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:28,975</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:32,350</end-time>
                <translation>这已经不再是国家与国家的战争</translation>
                <original>もはや国家対国家の戦争ではなくて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="179" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:32,350</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:39,475</end-time>
                <translation>政治学者们将其称为非对称战争</translation>
                <original>それを非対称的戦争っていう風に 政治学の人たちとか言いますけれども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="180" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:39,475</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:42,675</end-time>
                <translation>战争必然有敌人</translation>
                <original>戦争っていうのは敵がいるんです必ず</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="181" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:42,675</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:45,620</end-time>
                <translation>而且 对方也是和自己一样的人</translation>
                <original>そして相手も自分たちと同じ人間だとか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="182" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:45,620</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:48,375</end-time>
                <translation>或者和自己一样的国家</translation>
                <original>自分たちと同じ国だっていうことは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="183" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:48,375</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:51,450</end-time>
                <translation>这是进行战争的前提</translation>
                <original>前提でやるのが戦争なんですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="184" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:51,450</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:54,325</end-time>
                <translation>然而 一旦说是“非对称”</translation>
                <original>ところが非対称だって言ったら</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="185" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:54,325</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:56,925</end-time>
                <translation>就意味着不承认对方</translation>
                <original>相手はもう認めないわけですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="186" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:56,925</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:00,475</end-time>
                <translation>所以 如果是普通的战争</translation>
                <original>だから普通の戦争だと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="187" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:12:00,475</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:03,680</end-time>
                <translation>会有第三国或第三方介入
第三国とか第三者が間に入って</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="188" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:12:03,680</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:05,475</end-time>
                <translation>缔结和约对吧</translation>
                <original>講和を結ぶでしょ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="189" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:12:05,475</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:06,950</end-time>
                <translation>这既不会有这种谈判</translation>
                <original>そんな交渉もしないし</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="190" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:12:06,950</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:11,075</end-time>
                <translation>也就只剩下歼灭一途了</translation>
                <original>だから殲滅するだけだっていうことですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="191" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:12:11,075</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:13,200</end-time>
                <translation>也没有宣战布告之类的事吧</translation>
                <original>戦線布告みたいなこともないですもんね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="192" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:12:13,200</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:13,899</end-time>
                <translation>没有</translation>
                <original>ないです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="193" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:12:13,899</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:15,000</end-time>
                <translation>突然就开始了
突然始まって</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="194" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:12:15,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:19,950</end-time>
                <translation>比如 纽约发生了像911那样的事件</translation>
                <original>例えばニューヨークの ああいう事件の911のような出来事があると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="195" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:12:19,950</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:23,220</end-time>
                <translation>那么 这就意味着战争已经开始了</translation>
                <original>そうするともうすでに戦争が始まっているっていうことになるわけです</original>
