                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="198" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:12:28,750</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:31,540</end-time>
                <translation>就会觉得这一切都是坏的</translation>
                <original>それが全部悪いっていう風に</original>
