            <t index="219" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:24,950</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:26,150</end-time>
                <translation>由此</translation>
                <original>そこからね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="220" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:26,150</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:29,950</end-time>
                <translation>新的恐怖分子就会源源不断地产生</translation>
                <original>新たなテロリストがどんどんどんどん生まれてきちゃうわけです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="221" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:29,950</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:32,050</end-time>
                <translation>不仅如此</translation>
                <original>それだけではなくて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="222" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:32,050</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:34,875</end-time>
                <translation>因为恐怖分子大多在国内</translation>
                <original>テロリストが大体国内にいますから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="223" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:34,875</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:38,175</end-time>
                <translation>但总不能轰炸国内吧</translation>
