            </t>
            <t index="225" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:40,800</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:43,800</end-time>
                <translation>全世界都染上了瘟疫</translation>
                <original>世界中がね疫病にかかっていると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="226" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:43,800</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:48,350</end-time>
                <translation>国家就会采取一种体制 要将其病原菌</translation>
                <original>その病原菌を次回が次へと駆逐するっていう</original>
