            </t>
            <t index="227" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:48,350</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:51,850</end-time>
                <translation>一个接一个地彻底消灭</translation>
                <original>体制を国家が取るようになるんですよ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="228" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:51,850</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:55,450</end-time>
                <translation>我们来看看凯卢瓦的发言</translation>
                <original>カイヨワの発言を見ていきましょう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="229" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:55,450</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:59,125</end-time>
