                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="231" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:14:03,080</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:04,950</end-time>
                <translation>也会被优先进行
優先的に行われた</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="232" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:14:04,950</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:08,660</end-time>
                <translation>人们整个生活被重组</translation>
                <original>人々の生活全体が組み替えられてしまうのも</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="233" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:14:08,660</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:11,125</end-time>
                <translation>也并非遥远将来的事</translation>
                <original>遠い先のことではなかった</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
