            <t index="256" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:15:28,250</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:30,250</end-time>
                <translation>但又要不能畏惧恐怖主义</translation>
                <original>でもテロを恐れてはいけないと</original>
