                <end-time>00:21:29,525</end-time>
                <translation>像这样活着</translation>
                <original>こうやって生きてるんだよと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="363" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:21:29,525</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:32,450</end-time>
                <translation>活着就是这么一回事</translation>
                <original>生きるっていうのはこういうことなんだと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="364" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:21:32,450</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:37,475</end-time>
                <translation>我认为教育应该以此为基础</translation>
                <original>いうことをベースに教育することだったんじゃないかと思うんですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="365" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:21:37,475</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:39,680</end-time>
                <translation>想要毫无道理地破坏</translation>
                <original>理屈なく破壊がしたい</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="366" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:21:39,680</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:41,775</end-time>
                <translation>想要杀戮之类的事情</translation>
                <original>殺戮がしたいみたいなことが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="367" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:21:41,775</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:44,575</end-time>
                <translation>是那神圣事物的一部分</translation>
                <original>その聖なることの一つで</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="368" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:21:44,575</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:48,075</end-time>
                <translation>相反 人毫无道理地活着更好</translation>
                <original>その逆に理屈なく人は生きていた方がいい</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="369" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:21:48,075</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:50,500</end-time>
                <translation>如果要进行教育的话</translation>
                <original>もし教育をするとすれば</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="370" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:21:50,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:52,300</end-time>
                <translation>就要从这两方面</translation>
                <original>その両方で</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="371" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:21:52,300</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:54,920</end-time>
                <translation>战争的悲惨和反省
戦争の悲惨さも反省も</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="372" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:21:54,920</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:57,725</end-time>
                <translation>还有 那时候我们情绪高涨了之类的</translation>
                <original>あとあの時僕らは高まってしまったとか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="373" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:21:57,725</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:59,900</end-time>
                <translation>以及这或许本来就是这么回事之类的</translation>
                <original>そもそもそういうもんなんじゃないかみたいのを</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="374" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:21:59,900</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:02,900</end-time>
                <translation>也就是了解全部</translation>
                <original>もう全部知るっていう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="375" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:02,900</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:05,720</end-time>
                <translation>当然 了解全部是很困难的事</translation>
                <original>もちろんね全てを知るって大変なことだし</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="376" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:05,720</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:08,000</end-time>
                <translation>要说不断重复地教就能实现教育吗</translation>
                <original>たくさん教えれば教育ができるかって言うと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="377" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:08,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:09,450</end-time>
                <translation>也不是这么回事</translation>
                <original>そういう話でもないんですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="378" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:09,450</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:10,850</end-time>
                <translation>并非如此</translation>
                <original>そうじゃなくて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="379" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:10,850</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:12,775</end-time>
                <translation>其根本之处</translation>
                <original>根っこのところは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="380" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:12,775</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:15,350</end-time>
                <translation>是让任何人都能活下去</translation>
                <original>あらゆる人は生きていけるって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="381" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:15,350</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:18,650</end-time>
                <translation>那时我们看到旁边有困难的人</translation>
                <original>そうしたら隣で困ってるやつ見たらね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="382" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:18,650</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:20,975</end-time>
                <translation>伸出援手不是理所当然的吗</translation>
                <original>助けるのが普通じゃないかと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="383" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:20,975</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:23,075</end-time>
                <translation>但这种天经地义的事情</translation>
                <original>でもそのまったく当たり前のことが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="384" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:23,075</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:26,975</end-time>
                <translation>却被其他科技进步啦、文明啦
他の科学技術の進歩だとか文明だとか</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="385" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:26,975</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:28,975</end-time>
                <translation>或者是为了国家之类的</translation>
                <original>あるいは国家のためとか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="386" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:28,975</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:33,000</end-time>
                <translation>被这些名目全部碾碎了</translation>
                <original>そういうようなことで全部潰されていくと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="387" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:33,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:36,200</end-time>
                <translation>这样一来 就很容易走向战争了</translation>
                <original>そうしたらもう容易に戦争になるわけです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="388" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:36,200</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:39,600</end-time>
                <translation>所以要说针对战争的刹车</translation>
                <original>だからそれに対するストッパーって言ったらね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="389" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:39,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:41,925</end-time>
                <translation>就是对“某个人”</translation>
                <original>この人をね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="390" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:41,925</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:46,425</end-time>
                <translation>任何时候都不能做出伤害行为</translation>
                <original>傷つけるとかそんなことはとてもできないって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="391" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:46,425</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:48,625</end-time>
                <translation>希望他活下去</translation>
                <original>生きててくれっていうね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="392" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:48,625</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:50,625</end-time>
                <translation>一起活下去吧</translation>
                <original>一緒に生きようっていうね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="393" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:50,625</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:53,320</end-time>
                <translation>每回我都让气氛变得沉重
毎回重苦しい雰囲気にさせて</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="394" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:53,320</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:55,150</end-time>
                <translation>真是非常抱歉</translation>
                <original>大変申し訳なかったんですけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="395" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:55,150</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:56,750</end-time>
                <translation>不过呢</translation>
                <original>あのでもね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="396" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:22:56,750</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:00,080</end-time>
                <translation>伊集院 现在没那么悲伤了吧</translation>
                <original>伊集院さん今そんな悲しくないでしょ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="397" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:00,080</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:02,050</end-time>
                <translation>悲伤是悲伤</translation>
                <original>悲しかったりそう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="398" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:02,050</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:05,875</end-time>
                <translation>虽说世界并没有因此变得光明</translation>
                <original>これで世の中は明るくなったわけではないけれども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="399" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:05,875</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:10,050</end-time>
                <translation>但可以说我们获得了看透黑暗的能力</translation>
                <original>暗さを見通す力はついたっていう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="400" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:10,050</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:11,420</end-time>
                <translation>不知道能不能这么说呢</translation>
                <original>風に言えないですかね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="401" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:11,420</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:15,640</end-time>
                <translation>嗯 能懂 就像如果不知道有这种病</translation>
                <original>いや分かりますこういう病気があるんだってことを知らないと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="402" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:15,640</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:17,550</end-time>
                <translation>也就无法察觉它的前兆</translation>
                <original>その前兆も分からない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="403" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:17,550</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:20,100</end-time>
                <translation>还会做出错误的判断
し間違った判断を下す</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="404" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:20,100</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:22,140</end-time>
                <translation>说什么这是狐狸的诅咒</translation>
                <original>これは狐の呪いだなんつってね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="405" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:22,140</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:25,480</end-time>
                <translation>正是那种错误的应对</translation>
                <original>その間違った対処こそが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="406" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:25,480</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:27,020</end-time>
                <translation>更加让我的病情</translation>
                <original>より僕の病状を</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="407" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:27,020</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:29,400</end-time>
                <translation>让世间的病情恶化</translation>
                <original>世の中の病状を悪化させることだから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="408" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:29,400</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:31,000</end-time>
                <translation>了解这一点</translation>
                <original>そこを知るのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="409" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:31,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:33,600</end-time>
                <translation>是无论如何都绕不开的</translation>
                <original>避けては通れないことだとは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="410" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:33,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:36,050</end-time>
                <translation>是从了解开始的吗</translation>
                <original>知ることからなんですかね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="411" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:36,050</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:37,520</end-time>
                <translation>我们平安地读到了最后</translation>
                <original>無事に最後まで参りました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="412" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:37,520</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:38,400</end-time>
                <translation>是啊</translation>
                <original>そうですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="413" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:38,400</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:42,175</end-time>
                <translation>是的 西谷老师 感谢您这四回的讲解</translation>
                <original>はい西谷さん4回にわたってありがとうございました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="414" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:23:42,175</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:44,025</end-time>
                <translation>哪里哪里 您辛苦了</translation>
                <original>いえいえお疲れ様でした</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
